[2026-03-14T20:16:20.734Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CmJ9ahAtJWsdaywPVayHAC","type":"tool_result","content":"191:- **Expected**: The sidebar displays a \"Workspace\" section with links: \"All Projects\" (folder icon), \"All Teams\" (users icon), \"Members\" (user-plus icon), \"Labels\" (tag icon), \"Settings\" (settings icon).\n203:#### Test: Sidebar Members link navigates correctly\n205:- **Action**: User clicks \"Members\" in the workspace section\n279:- **Expected**: Workspace section items (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings) are visible as icons and remain clickable.\n1889:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`. Lead selector is open. Members: \"Jane Doe\", \"Alice Smith\", \"Bob Jones\".\n2106:## Members Page (`/settings/members`)\n2112:#### Test: Members page renders with list of all workspace members\n2114:- **Expected**: A list/table is displayed showing all 3 members. Each row shows the member's avatar, name, email, role badge (Admin or Member), and team badges. The \"Invite Member\" button is visible at the top of the page. The page title reads \"Members\".\n2120:#### Test: Members list shows correct role badges with visual distinction\n2124:#### Test: Members list shows team badges for each member\n2128:#### Test: Members list shows member with no teams\n2132:#### Test: Members page shows empty state when no members exist\n2136:#### Test: Members list updates after inviting a new member\n2141:#### Test: Members list updates after removing a member\n2369:- **Expected**: The team settings view displays: Team name field showing \"Engineering\" (inline editable), Identifier prefix field showing \"ENG\" (inline editable), Description field showing \"Core engineering team\" (inline editable), and a \"Team Members\" section listing current members. A \"Back\" or navigation link to return to the teams list is visible. A \"Delete Team\" button is also present.\n2408:- **Expected**: The Team Members section displays a list of 3 members. Each member row shows their avatar and name. An \"Add Member\" button is visible.\n2413:- **Expected**: David is added to the team. The Team Members section now shows 3 members including David. The team card on the teams page reflects the updated member count. David's member row on the Members page (`/settings/members`) now includes an \"Engineering\" team badge.\n2422:- **Action**: User clicks the remove button next to Carol's name in the Team Members list\n2428:- **Expected**: The member is not removed. The Team Members list still shows 3 members.\n2432:- **Expected**: The Team Members section shows an empty state message (e.g., \"No members yet. Add members to this team.\"). The \"Add Member\" button is visible.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lt4kmTNVJcWUKGy4MGpym4","session_id":"0cb8a77f-e3f9-4be7-8a8f-dba07d05e94d","uuid":"f2d002ac-434f-482d-943b-88ace5fd8e43"}
