[2026-03-14T20:16:54.098Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013DRy4ycDD3JakRoEA3QFQg","type":"tool_result","content":"   223→### Members Page (`/settings/members`)\n   224→\n   225→List of all workspace members.\n   226→\n   227→**Member Row**:\n   228→- Avatar\n   229→- Name\n   230→- Email\n   231→- Role (Admin, Member)\n   232→- Teams they belong to (as badges)\n   233→\n   234→**Actions**:\n   235→- \"Invite Member\" button → modal with email field\n   236→- Change role dropdown\n   237→- Remove member (with confirmation)\n   238→\n   239→### Teams Management Page (`/settings/teams`)\n   240→\n   241→**Team Card**:\n   242→- Team name\n   243→- Identifier prefix (e.g., \"ENG\")\n   244→- Member count\n   245→- Active cycle name (if any)\n   246→\n   247→**Create Team** button → modal:\n   248→- Name (required)\n   249→- Identifier prefix (required, uppercase, 2-5 chars)\n   250→- Description\n   251→\n   252→Click a team card to see team settings:\n   253→- Edit name, description, identifier\n   254→- Manage team members (add/remove)\n   255→\n   256→### Labels Page (`/settings/labels`)\n   257→\n   258→**Label List**:\n   259→- Each label shows: Colored dot, name, issue count using this label\n   260→- Edit button (inline edit name and color)\n   261→- Delete button (with confirmation)\n   262→\n   263→**Create Label** button:\n   264→- Name field\n   265→- Color picker (preset colors + custom hex)\n   266→\n   267→### Settings Page (`/settings`)\n   268→\n   269→Workspace-level settings:\n   270→- Workspace name (editable)\n   271→- Default team for new issues\n   272→\n   273→## Keyboard Shortcuts\n   274→\n   275→The app supports keyboard shortcuts for power users:\n   276→- `C` — Open create issue modal\n   277→- `G` then `I` — Go to My Issues\n   278→- `G` then `N` — Go to Inbox\n   279→\n   280→## Visual Design\n   281→\n   282→The app has a clean, minimal, modern design:\n   283→\n   284→- **Color scheme**: Dark mode by default. Background `#0f1117`, surface `#1a1d24`, borders `#2a2d35`, primary accent `#5e6ad2` (Linear's signature purple-blue).\n   285→- **Typography**: System font stack (Inter preferred). Issue titles 14px medium, descriptions 13px regular, labels/metadata 12px.\n   286→- **Spacing**: Compact but readable. Issue rows ~36px height. Generous whitespace in detail views.\n   287→- **Animations**: Subtle transitions on hover states and dropdown opens (150ms ease).\n   288→- **Empty states**: Friendly messages with icons when lists are empty (e.g., \"No issues yet. Create your first issue to get started.\")\n   289→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lt4kmTNVJcWUKGy4MGpym4","session_id":"0cb8a77f-e3f9-4be7-8a8f-dba07d05e94d","uuid":"b4c19e55-135c-455f-be9e-18a17cf53d52"}
